# held buttons and the knobs (X0X's ways): a held button does nothing on its release (no cards since 1.3.0); SAVE
# held on goes back to the recipe; a few quick clicks are exact, a quick spin sweeps
wait 300
# each knob's help line fits the rule above the knobs (it shows there while the knob turns)
expect helpfit 0
press REC
wait 1000
shot help_rec.png
release REC
wait 200
expect frozen 0
# REC: dub hold, and again: let go
tap REC
wait 200
expect frozen 1
tap REC
wait 200
expect frozen 0
# the Chord page's Throws (KNOB 2), from a known value
tap ENV
spin K2 -100
spin K2 60
expect par111 60
wait 500
turn K2 3 10
expect par111 63
wait 500
turn K2 -3 30
expect par111 60
wait 500
turn K2 -12 10
expect par111 0
wait 500
turn K2 2 100
expect par111 2
wait 1500
press GLO
wait 1000
shot help_save.png
wait 700
release GLO
wait 200
# the recipe's Throws again (not the 2 it was left at)
expect par111 >20
expect store_writes 0
# the tempo from a known value: the Key page's first knob (HOME, HOME again) down to its lowest
tap HOME
tap HOME
expect view 18
spin K1 -100
expect par18 90
tap FX
turn K2 1 80
wait 100
shot space_turning.png
# HOME + SELECT: the tempo, from any page (and the page stays)
press HOME
turn SELECT 3 100
release HOME
expect par18 93
expect view 5
